箭头语法：
```java
enum Result {
    GREAT,
    FINE,
}

Result result = switch (ch) {
    case 'A' -> Result.GREAT;
    case 'B', 'C' -> Result.FINE;
    default -> throw new Exception();
};
```

pages.content:
箭头语法：
```java
enum Result {
    GREAT,
    FINE,
}

Result result = switch (ch) {
    case 'A' -> Result.GREAT;
    case 'B', 'C' -> Result.FINE;
    default -> throw new Exception();
};
```

```java
Result result = switch (ch) {
    case 'A':
        yield Result.GREAT;
    case 'B':
    case 'C':
        yield Result.FINE;
    default:
        throw new Exception();
};
```

```java
switch (ch) {
    case 'A':
        doSomething();
        break;
    case 'B':
    case 'C':
        doSomethingElse();
        break;
    default:
        doSomethingDifferent();
        break;
}
```

