return 语句用于结束方法执行并返回一个值。方法返回的值写在 return 关键字后面。如果方法返回的类型不是 void，则必须使用 return 语句返回某个值。

void doSomething(boolean streamClosed) {
    // If streamClosed is true, execution is stopped
    if (streamClosed) {
        return;
    }
    readFromStream();
}

int calculateSum(int a, int b) {
    int result = a + b;
    return result;
}
return 语句立即结束执行，只有一种情况除外：如果该语句是在 try 块中遇到，并且与 finally 互补，控制将传递给 finally 块。

void doSomething(boolean streamClosed) {
    try {
        if (streamClosed) {
            return;
        }
        readFromStream();
    } finally {
        // Will be called last even if readFromStream() was not called
        freeResources();
    }
}

